# Images for the Workshop page, played in Nelim's Sanctuary Backlot (GALLERY.md).
#
# Every gallery capture is a staged photograph, the menu excepted. One story, one place, one fixed set of decor
# that stays the same from one image to the next (same table, same deck, same fire, same lamps, same pots), so the
# four images read as one evening in one clearing, and for each image a subject whose every detail suits it.
# RECOMPOSED 2026-11-18 (owner: delete all and recompose) after score-gallery on the four captures: wide j weak at 268 px
# (nine black blobs), jug hiding Nelim's mouth, portrait Nelim small and faceless, close bare upper sand and no Pants,
# family baby 9 px. Director pass (Opus, one call): the nine species are SPLIT across the four scenes (each at least once),
# each frame is set so the key animal is 15 px or more at 268 px, Nelim never carries the jug (it stands on the ground as decor,
# so her face and Pants show), the fixed set moves south so the action fills the frame.
#
# THE STORY: "Milk night in the clearing". One Saturday in the Sanctuary, 17h to 20h, one hour of game time between
# scenes, clear sky. The ebbbs like cheese, and cheese starts as milk. Nelim, the protagonist (owner rule 2026-10-14),
# sets the evening's milk down for her goo animals in the cream clearing (`calm-zone`, free zone validated by the owner
# on 2026-11-07, decor ours and removed after each shot). Two guests share the little table with her in image 1: Soren and Miel,
# the two NSB colonists (daily looks, authorised by the owner on 2026-10-25; Miel's look validated 2026-11-17 in VALIDE.md,
# played here as before, small). Everyone smiles calmly. The evening goes from golden dusk to night and the guests leave after
# image 1: the stools are empty from image 2 on. Warm saturated cloth against creatures that are black goo, so the creatures are
# what the eye lands on. Nelim keeps her own face, eyes and own bun in all four scenes; no hat (hat rule 2026-10-18).
# Outfit continuity (d): same sand khaki Apparel_Pants and mustard Apparel_CollarShirt all evening (put on first, Pants before the
# shirt, so the legs show); she adds the teal Apparel_Jacket when the air cools (2 and 3) and swaps it for the indigo Apparel_Duster at night (4).
# The five species of image 1, the two giants of 2, ebbb and beee of 3 and the ebbb family of 4 cover all nine.
#
# THE FIXED SET (b, same cells in every scene, laid and removed per scene): a plank deck (floor WoodPlankFloor from (196, 184)
# to (204, 190)) under the table Table2x2c at (199, 187) with stools at (198, 187) and (201, 188); TorchLamp lit at (196, 188)
# and (204, 188); Campfire lit at (197, 190); daylily PlantPots (pot holding Plant_Daylily fully grown) at (196, 190) and (204, 190);
# Shelf at (202, 190); SculptureSmall at (195, 184). A Milk jug stands on the ground as decor in every scene (cell per scene below).
# Light sources inside every frame, ground never bare, plants alive.
#
#   1. 17h, golden dusk, wide shot, score target 5. EPISODE: she has just set the jug down and straightened up, the herd closes in from both sides, her guests watch.
#         Place calm-zone, Clear, 60 ticks of set-up then the hour holds. Composition (f): frame (196, 185) to (204, 190) filling 90 percent of the screen
#         (9 x 6 cells, about 162 px per cell, whole set and both lamps in frame), Nelim right of centre, the table at the left, the herd round the jug.
#         Living (c): five species, Drebbbd at (197, 186), Ebbbomination at (199, 185) two cells from the jug, Bebbbholder at (204, 186), Crebbb at (205, 188),
#         Ebbberration at (202, 189) behind her, every animal facing South (front view; East and West facings are asked of NPT).
#         Pawns (d): Nelim at (202, 186) facing South, hands free, Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (222, 170, 60), Apparel_Pants rgb (196, 170, 130),
#         own bun, SocialRelax smile; Soren on the stool (198, 187), Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (110, 130, 150),
#         Apparel_Pants, Apparel_Jacket, hair Roo_HD_Hair_Tidy, mouth MouthLittle; Miel on the stool (201, 188),
#         Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (196, 150, 80), Apparel_Pants, Apparel_Jacket, hair Roo_Royal_NaturalcurlsHD, mouth MouthClassicSmile.
#         Milk decor at (201, 186) at her west side. Action (e): INSTANT: she has just set the jug down, her guests are already seated, the herd has just turned to the milk.
#         Obtained by the Milk decor, `sits on the building "Stool"` for each guest, each animal `stands at` its cell `facing South` after the pause, then `time is paused for the capture`.
#         Subject (g): the whole offer, read in the image alone: a smiling woman beside a jug at a lamplit table, two guests seated, five different goo creatures closing in on the milk.
#         Mod (j): five different silhouettes, about 45 px each at 268 px, round a woman of about 34 px.
#
#   2. 18h, dusk, portrait, score target 5. EPISODE: the two giants of the herd come for their share and lean over the table toward her.
#         Same set, guests gone, frame (195, 184) to (204, 188) filling 90 percent of the screen (10 x 5 cells, about 173 px per cell).
#         Nelim at (200, 185) facing South between the giants, hands free, Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (222, 170, 60), Apparel_Pants rgb (196, 170, 130),
#         Apparel_Jacket rgb (30, 110, 120), SocialRelax smile. Milk decor at (199, 184) at her feet. Thrumebbb at (197, 186) and Goliebbb at (203, 186),
#         both facing South. Action (e): INSTANT: the two giants have just reached the table from both sides and lowered their heads toward her and the jug,
#         she stands still between them, smiling. Obtained by the Milk decor, `stands at (200, 185) facing South`, each animal `stands at` its cell `facing South`, then `time is paused for the capture`.
#         Subject (g): the two giants lean over the table toward Nelim and the milk. Mod (j): thrumebbb about 116 px (horn, teeth) and goliebbb about 96 px at 268 px.
#
#   3. 19h, deep dusk, close shot, score target 5. EPISODE: a quiet moment by the lamp, an ebbb noses the jug while a beee sidles up to her.
#         Same set, frame (197, 185) to (201, 188) filling 90 percent of the screen (5 x 4 cells, about 243 px per cell, table and both stools whole, the lamp (196, 188) in frame).
#         Nelim at (200, 186) facing West looking at the ebbb, Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (222, 170, 60), Apparel_Pants rgb (196, 170, 130), Apparel_Jacket rgb (30, 110, 120), SocialRelax smile.
#         Milk decor at (198, 185) on the deck; ebbb at (199, 185) at the jug, beee at (202, 186) at her right side, both facing South.
#         Action (e): INSTANT: she has just set the jug down, the ebbb bends to it and the beee sidles up to her. Obtained by the Milk decor on the ground,
#         `stands at (200, 186) facing West`, each animal `stands at` its cell `facing South`, then `time is paused for the capture`.
#         Subject (g): by lamplight an ebbb noses the milk while a beee sidles up to Nelim. Mod (j): ebbb about 34 px, beee about 68 px at 268 px, Nelim about 50 px.
#
#   4. 20h, night, family, score target 5. EPISODE: night falls, the guests have gone, the ebbb family comes out to the milk by the fire.
#         Same set, map light dimmed to at most 0.55 after the hour is set (step `the light of the map is dimmed to at most {float}`, lamps and fire stay lit and warm on the group),
#         frame (196, 189) to (199, 190) filling 90 percent of the screen (4 x 2 cells, about 432 px per cell, fire (197, 190) and pot (196, 190) whole, the table out of frame).
#         Nelim at (198, 190) facing South, hands free, Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (222, 170, 60), Apparel_Pants rgb (196, 170, 130), Apparel_Duster rgb (60, 50, 130), SocialRelax smile.
#         Milk decor at (197, 189) in front of the fire. Three ebbbs: adult (stage 2) at (196, 189), baby (stage 0) at (198, 189) at her feet, juvenile (stage 1) at (199, 189), all facing South.
#         Action (e): INSTANT: the baby has just reached the jug at her feet, the adult is at the jug from the other side and the juvenile looks up. Obtained by the Milk decor,
#         `stands at (198, 190) facing South`, each animal `stands at` its cell `facing South` and `faces South` after the pause, then `time is paused for the capture`.
#         Subject (g): night falls, the ebbb family, baby to adult, gathers at the milk by the fire. Mod (j): life stages, adult about 60 px, juvenile about 30 px, baby about 15 px at 268 px.
#
#   5. A MENU (interface, not scored): the information card of an ebbb showing Wildness, plain capture on `window-backdrop-for-height`, cropped on the sides.
#
#   - Pass: wsl-deps.gallery-looks.map, English. Every other pass skips this feature.
#   - There is no cheese mod loaded: the only dairy the game has is Milk, which stands on the ground as decor.
#   - The clearing is x 195-205, z 183-191. East and West facing of animals is not in the steps catalogue (South only): asked of NPT, until then every animal faces South.
#   - RISK + PLAN (h, not scored): camera clamp about 10 x 6 cells may crop the edges of 1 and 2 (Crebbb at (205, 188), Goliebbb right edge): plan B Crebbb (203, 184), Goliebbb (202, 186).
#     Baby at 15 px is borderline: plan B frame (197, 189) to (199, 190), 3 x 2. Night not visible in 4: the light step had no visible effect last run, ask NPT. Pants may not show: ask NPT for a
#     Pants assertion. The hostile species (Drebbbd, Ebbbomination) may wander if `faces` does not hold them. Giants may hide the lamps and stools in 2, Nelim must draw in front.
#   - SHOTLIST ESTIMATE: set by score-gallery in STATUS.md, "Gallery recompose 2026-11-18".
#   - Not here: the A Dog Said 2 recipe and the Nocturnal Animals clock need other maps and other passes.
#
# Raw captures land outside the committed gallery; the finished images go to Art/Gallery/ numbered 1- to 5- (subtitles on 1 to 4, none on the card).
